{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ef8fd00335c6f1ac842a8ec1dd2b363b0d17f0dd101c34d46b71b8c00f78036b", "ja": "うん、これでよし……。結構凝った衣装だからな。\n雪歩、他に気になる所はないか？", "zh": "嗯，这样就行了……这套服装做工真的很精细。\n雪步，你还有其他在意的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3c8d1217fc5b632ca65efa8e652c907ba38a762bdfa936802ec089b5b99a45f9", "ja": "はい、大丈夫ですぅ……えへへ。\n本当に、とっても素敵な衣装ですよね……♪", "zh": "嗯，没问题了……嘿嘿。\n这套服装真的很好看呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8cc217e1482744d5fb17afc7e38b0bf7037fc482ec0b135d1bf6837436c6646d", "ja": "じゃあ、着替えてから……次のお仕事に……。", "zh": "那我去换衣服……准备开始下一个工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7c42f540155c25cfb8b4577bf918e32e41f03ab1527d4783c75caff76af91e36", "ja": "はうっ！\nお、思い出しました{$P$}！", "zh": "啊呜！\n我、我想起来了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d2be8857baa70cd461c885a0b199a550804a8efbb5b0f5874ea3f40a1cc38636", "ja": "うわ！　ど、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "哇！怎、怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ae490506d8a4781cec2c15ec35853099c91e71cfe0bc3ca44b987a9a6ff6e182", "ja": "本当に、本当にありがとうございますぅ！\nこの衣装、とっても素敵です～！", "zh": "真的、真的很谢谢你！\n我觉得这套服装非常漂亮～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "73eb0cc930da0ee0f495b8f3dcd8cfa1f06cf2cdbb9f927c8d3ef9a75e6eff88", "ja": "ふう……あぶないところでしたぁ……。", "zh": "呼……真的好险……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b9a3438aeac377d261c2e486faa1af4d465bffa4f742a75211749f4371045439", "ja": "……うん？", "zh": "……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "56f86dc1a322cf4325bf9291bbf1e570f533a11e3a5f795ba26222a068ca5012", "ja": "私、ぼーっとしちゃってて。すっかりお礼を言うのを\n忘れちゃってて……。うう、ごめんなさい～！", "zh": "我一直发呆，都忘记要跟你道谢了……\n呜呜，对不起～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1009_p", "source_sha256": "cfc4e25fef8814b549dff24bcdd31823260c8212434f1c7d42fc4b0f1d805f58", "ja": "ああ、お礼が言いたかったのか？\nでも、そんなに気にしなくても……。", "zh": "原来你是想道谢呀？\n这用不着放在心上啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ac7428ccf9ab8ee4185a2fdddc6fa4286e2bda4a92ced2fadb0855a217446de7", "ja": "そんなことないです。いっぱいお世話になってるんです\nから、せめてお礼くらい、ちゃんと言わないと……。", "zh": "这可不行，我总是麻烦你做这么多事，\n所以至少要好好道谢才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "129d49ba791c931dad13b86a7b0e5fff034ad64c4f59ad50479d3873bc338923", "ja": "私、きっとこの衣装をもらったせいで勘違いして、\n大魔王気分に浸っちゃってたんです……。", "zh": "我一定是因为收到这套服装后产生错觉，\n误以为自己就是大魔王……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7b8827c2ef16ca0aacccd646fa92e44d14b0bedc304f52e71702865d03c16941", "ja": "うう、偉そうに調子に乗っちゃってごめんなさい～！\nこんな私は、穴掘って埋まってイチから出直しますぅ！", "zh": "呜呜，对不起我这么得意忘形～！\n我要挖洞把这样的自己埋起来，重新来过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ca43103cd0d9ac6a8df67cf4252c4e908356bf7334a209c9a7f09ba42d5baff7", "ja": "ああっ、掘るな埋まるな出直すな！\nお礼ぐらいで、そんな大げさな。", "zh": "唉唷，你别挖洞埋自己也别重新来过！\n不过就是道谢而已，太夸张了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d44eb04882e4b7f92aa31114babd007fa167e8499ef45ac758b3d17bc9cdf087", "ja": "で、でも、もともとダメダメな私が、感謝の気持ちすら\nなくしたら……人として本当にダメダメかもって……。", "zh": "可、可是我本来就不行不行了，要是再不知感恩……\n真的就是个不行不行的人了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d97b2be03a9286f384f20099cda2b1f3e17ed5f800e80066dd48a0653e2d6a34", "ja": "なんか深い話になってきたような……\nまあ、感謝の気持ちは大事だと思うよ。", "zh": "感觉话题变得越来越沉重了……\n我是觉得心怀谢意很重要没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1016_p", "source_sha256": "adddbdce2734ba34ad3041b601c1255293b72f13f4fbe3a134be4cb0cb2e2905", "ja": "でも大丈夫。\nお礼なら、もうちゃんともらったから。", "zh": "但你不用担心，\n我确实有收到你的感谢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0b585caaff4b7de7861ecfb65a4c1c0fe47280755177b8f0caa986adc591b1d4", "ja": "えっ？　そんなはずないって思いますけど……。\nあの、思い違いとかじゃ……？", "zh": "咦？我应该没有道谢过才对啊……\n那个，你是不是有什么误会……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4b06cc00bd4fa1ccc5e020917e7df0c2eaefe264b4d92a51d8232f5146956da8", "ja": "いや、雪歩は今さっきも衣装を着て、\nうっとりするぐらい喜んでくれてただろ？", "zh": "真的有，雪步刚才也穿着这套服装，\n整个人陶醉在欢喜的情绪里不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1019_p", "source_sha256": "26c7032b8275c868e5e45286ad306b32ac3fdee938bc3b3d3a5c032e25590262", "ja": "気に入ってくれたことが伝わってきて、どんなお礼の\n言葉よりもうれしかったよ。……ありがとう、雪歩。", "zh": "你喜欢它的心情有传达过来，这比任何\n道谢的话语都令我感到开心……谢谢你，雪步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3558f0419010f7b8338d992b9f3acf81787562d5f2d7c769affff029456ea95c", "ja": "じゃあ、あの、もしかして……\n他にも、伝わってますか？", "zh": "那请问，是不是……\n还有其他的感觉也传达给你了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1022_p", "source_sha256": "fdabd1a90ff1f7ec73ff8093d23755017c3ef3c430182ac42ec921f6d1a35250", "ja": "え？　他にもって……何かあったっけ？", "zh": "咦？其他的感觉……还有什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1023_004yuk", "source_sha256": "77c49dc5c021f11595870c518570de64a1051fd1ab25323e7a1eb30b47b85069", "ja": "えへへ。\nずっと私の中にある……大事な気持ち……。", "zh": "嘿嘿。\n一直藏在我心中……重要的心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1024_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c7418b81f2534ab39492bbb880ecc2f52ae42cda1e1dec4cad6d5277138a618e", "ja": "あ、やっぱりなんでもないです！\nこれは、まだフワッとしてて……まだ、内緒で……。", "zh": "啊，什么事都没有！\n这份心意还很飘渺……不能跟别人说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1025_p", "source_sha256": "834cb19661d2283baf8a9fc00ea36bac0bdd509406c7ccfe08ee981f82832493", "ja": "内緒の気持ちか……。\nなんだろうな？", "zh": "不能说的心意啊……\n会是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1026_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d9fceffc8b38d761da0f0c63d36353d1b16852fe2656764947bbc47939cc40dc", "ja": "ひう！　だ、ダメですぅ！\n想像しないでください～！　ダメ～～！", "zh": "呜呜！不、不行啦！\n请你别乱想～！不行～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0084_1027_p", "source_sha256": "a7e7887e9e50347e6a225681a9f4203e23ed36cde58e66b729ac306514de7b7c", "ja": "（真っ赤になって照れている……。大魔王がこの\n調子なら、世界に笑顔があふれそうだな！）", "zh": "（瞧她脸红成这样……大魔王如果是这个样子，\n感觉世界就会充满欢笑呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
